    "long_instructions": "# Final Polish\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll make final improvements to your app before sharing it.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use AI Tutor to imagine two different users for your app.\r\n\r\n2. Ask what might be confusing, hard to use, or missing for those users.\r\n\r\n3. Choose one improvement to make based on those user needs.\r\n\r\n4. Test your app one more time.\r\n   - Does your dataset render correctly?\r\n   - Do your search, filter, or sort features work?\r\n   - Is your app clear and easy to use?\r\n\r\nFocus on the improvement that will have the biggest impact for your users.",
